{"title":"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram shown, what are the coordinates of point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/2/672e0f12b68a9c39634623aaf16f6fbbff310c72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ (4, 0) \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ (2, 2) \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ (2, 0) \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ (4, 4) \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ (2, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"508\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the graph shown, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6ad1a85eb168230836dc665b0c07d7612e3a2b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } (2, 4)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"87\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=